nt 2's point about B's strengths and concerns. Then present C's facts: correct decisions quickly, 100% reliable, creates positive atmosphere. Concern: difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric, not willing to further education. So we can argue that C's reliability and crew atmosphere outweigh B's concerns, but communication is a concern. We can say we currently lean towards C.\n\nThus vote for Candidate C.\n\nWe must produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: include our recommendation, reference Agent 2's points, give evidence, explain implication.\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
